  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safeguarding Workshop - OKUP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We would like to support CAFOD&#x2019;s partner OKUP with the opportunity to receive training on safeguarding, reporting and managing sensitive complaints and aligning safeguarding with the existing child protection policy. This training will provide a space for OKUP to reflect on the way they engage with people and communities, particularly vulnerable women and girls, and will provide them with the latest information and guidance on safeguarding and reporting. This training should be interactive and may include practical exercises as per the consultant&#x2019;s recommendations. The London based Bangladesh Programme Officer will be visiting Bangladesh at the time of the proposed training and will therefore attend and participate.</narrative>
  </description>
